00:50:58.585 --> 00:51:00.290
&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; Rose, thank you so much for coming.

00:51:00.290 --> 00:51:02.125
&gt;&gt; Thank you, this is awesome.

00:51:02.125 --> 00:51:02.765
&gt;&gt; It's been a real honor and pleasure.

